  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/72f16e379551718747b91306a5179efcf8e42596\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/72f16e379551718747b91306a5179efcf8e42596\" data-origin-width=\"908\" data-origin-height=\"530\"></div><p>이 그림 아시죠? ^^</p><p>세포호흡에서</p><p>&#39;전자전달계에서 ATP생성&#39; 과정을 한눈에 보여주는 도해자료입니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>많은 지식이 포함되어 있는 이 내용을 어떻게 가르쳐야 할까요?</p><p>------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\"><b>GPT와 수업 논의를 시작합니다.</b></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d8d88d9e29ff8ac640bdfa196b9024da17a3aba4\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d8d88d9e29ff8ac640bdfa196b9024da17a3aba4\" data-origin-width=\"681\" data-origin-height=\"210\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/86d3d9df886bb0eb7cc1b9339252d314aff3393d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/86d3d9df886bb0eb7cc1b9339252d314aff3393d\" data-origin-width=\"681\" data-origin-height=\"278\"></div><p><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\"><b>추상적이되 정보는 담겨있는 그림을 제시하라고 해서</b></span></p><p><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\"><b>아래와 같은 학습지(관찰력 테스트)를 만듭니다.</b></span><b></b></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e5193f5600ba02464b49df9bd92af7edca3c9e28\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"484\" height=\"595\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e5193f5600ba02464b49df9bd92af7edca3c9e28\" data-origin-width=\"572\" data-origin-height=\"703\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/16efb1e36d6f8245bd69c149e14c1d01e545f7cf\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"605\" height=\"400\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/16efb1e36d6f8245bd69c149e14c1d01e545f7cf\" data-origin-width=\"702\" data-origin-height=\"464\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/59c8234d776efc7b66ca8be0555cf02ad75a7991\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/59c8234d776efc7b66ca8be0555cf02ad75a7991\" data-origin-width=\"717\" data-origin-height=\"659\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/22552fbd89eb9ada301346341c67c6a82a7bb08e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/22552fbd89eb9ada301346341c67c6a82a7bb08e\" data-origin-width=\"707\" data-origin-height=\"413\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/965cf8b7fa663e1d1f27ddc9e2f76ea614c2f606\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/965cf8b7fa663e1d1f27ddc9e2f76ea614c2f606\" data-origin-width=\"690\" data-origin-height=\"265\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4246326f2e2abd01c1951e144f1fdd601c9e79f5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4246326f2e2abd01c1951e144f1fdd601c9e79f5\" data-origin-width=\"687\" data-origin-height=\"655\"></div><p>&#160;</p